    "id": "obj_1",
    "text": "Add 100s and some tens to a number within 1,000. Use the arrow way.",
    "origin": "adapted",
    "source_ref": {
      "src": "src1",
      "page": "n/a",
      "section": "Lesson objective"
    }
  },
  "prerequisite_ids": [],
  "explanations": [
    {
      "id": "exp_1",
      "title": "Add in chunks",
      "text": "To add 110 to 420, add 100 first. Then add 10. 420 plus 110 equals 530.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_arrow"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "exp_2",
      "title": "Make the next hundred",
      "text": "280 plus 220: add 200 to 280 to get 480. Then add 20 to make 500.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_arrow"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "exp_3",
      "title": "Use a problem you know",
      "text": "470 plus 210 is 680. For 470 plus 230, add 20 more to 680.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_arrow"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "exp_4",
      "title": "Close to the next hundred",
      "text": "590 is just 10 away from 600. Take 10 from the other number to make 600.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_bond"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "ex_1",
      "title": "420 plus 110",
      "text": "420 plus 100 is 520. 520 plus 10 is 530. We added 110 in all. 420 plus 110 equals 530.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_arrow"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_2",
      "title": "550 plus 260",
      "text": "550 plus 200 is 750. 750 plus 50 is 800. 800 plus 10 is 810.",
      "asset_ids": [
        "a_arrow"
      ],
      "origin": "adapted",
      "source_ref": {
        "src": "src1",
        "page": "n/a",
        "section": "Concept Development"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_3",
      "title": "280 plus 230",
      "text": "280 plus 200 is 480. 480 plus 20 makes 500. 500 plus 10 is 510.",
